    "title": "QUESTION: Missed 2 rak with d imam,I joined him whn he ws sayin d takbeer 2 rise 2 d 3rd rak,then I thot mybe he was not erect nd I ws standin(standin before he stood),so I broke my pryr,then started again nd I didnt complete my fatihah and he said takbeer(fearin not completin the fatihah) I broke my pryr again nd joined him again nd continued my pryr. Wht shud b done here nd is my pryr vld",
