    "question": "Once during a Jumuah prayer,the mic of the mosque malfunctioned and we couldn&#8217;t hear anything,only bits of sounds were coming every now and then.As the people on the upper floors couldn&#8217;t see the imam, they improvised based on the bits they could hear.I was in the 2nd floor, without knowing what to do I followed them.I don&#8217;t know if the prayer was valid. What should we have done in such situation?",
    "title": "QUESTION: Once during a Jumuah prayer,the mic of the mosque malfunctioned and we couldn&#8217;t hear anything,only bits of sounds were coming every now and then.As the people on the upper floors couldn&#8217;t see the imam, they improvised based on the bits they could hear.I was in the 2nd floor, without knowing what to do I followed them.I don&#8217;t know if the prayer was valid. What should we have done in such situation?",
