    "question": "If a person misses Fajr due to sleep and wakes after its time but does not pray it immediately and delays it until Dhuhr, is it permissible to pray it then, or must it be offered as soon as one wakes?",
    "title": "QUESTION: If a person misses Fajr due to sleep and wakes after its time but does not pray it immediately and delays it until Dhuhr, is it permissible to pray it then, or must it be offered as soon as one wakes?",
