    "question": "How to compensate the Salah if In hurry I didn&#8217;t sit properly in Iftirash ? &#038; realise it later .How to rectify my mistake? Should I break my Salah &#038; start it from the beginning?",
    "title": "QUESTION: How to compensate the Salah if In hurry I didn&#8217;t sit properly in Iftirash ? &#038; realise it later .How to rectify my mistake? Should I break my Salah &#038; start it from the beginning?",
    "answer": "Iftirash is a way of sitting down according to the sunnah. If you sit in any other way, the prayer is valid. If you don’t sit between the two prostrations, the prayer is invalid as you had missed a pillar.",
