    "title": "QUESTION: If a person is travelling from one country to another to their relatives house and is going to stay there for 15-20 days do they have to pray full namaz or will be it qasr even if they have all comfort of a house there.. coz here people say even if a person has all the comfort but they are travelling they don’t have to pray full namaz even if they are staying there for more than a month also",
