    "modified": "2025-02-20T12:40:19",
    "link": "https://www.assimalhakeem.net/question-if-i-try-to-pray-tahhiyat-al-masjid-before-maghrib-people-object-to-it-saying-it-is-haram-to-pray-somebody-stopped-my-prayer-should-i-just-enter-the-masjid-late-or-sit-down-without/",
