    "question": "What do I do when I join a salat late and once the iman finish he has a sujud sahw to do . Should I do that with him before completing my missed rak’ats or do it once I finish my salat",
    "title": "QUESTION: What do I do when I join a salat late and once the iman finish he has a sujud sahw to do . Should I do that with him before completing my missed rak’ats or do it once I finish my salat",
