    "question": "After finishing my fard prayer i moved a step aside to start pray sunnah prayer. Then for nafl prayer whether i can pray on the same place (where i prayed my sunnah prayer) or i have to move again as i did after finishing fard prayer ? And the answer will be applicable for ladies too ?",
    "title": "QUESTION: After finishing my fard prayer i moved a step aside to start pray sunnah prayer. Then for nafl prayer whether i can pray on the same place (where i prayed my sunnah prayer) or i have to move again as i did after finishing fard prayer ? And the answer will be applicable for ladies too ?",
