    "question": "I fell off the bike and hurt my legs now Sheikh i want to pray Jummah prayer but I can&#8217;t do ruku and sajdah I tried but it&#8217;s very hurting my legs can I pray while sitting down on floor should I get less reward.",
    "title": "QUESTION: I fell off the bike and hurt my legs now Sheikh i want to pray Jummah prayer but I can&#8217;t do ruku and sajdah I tried but it&#8217;s very hurting my legs can I pray while sitting down on floor should I get less reward.",
    "answer": "If you can stand, you must stand during the standing part and you can sit on the chair for ruku and sujood if you cannot do it normally.",
