    "question": "It happens I pray 3times in different mosques. How many times do I pray tahiyat masjid?",
    "title": "QUESTION: It happens I pray 3times in different mosques. How many times do I pray tahiyat masjid?",
    "answer": "Everytime you enter the masjid, you must pray before sitting down, it can be any prayer, whether 2 specific rakahs of tahiyatul masjid, sunnah before the obligatory prayer or fard prayer itself. If you don’t sit down and immediately join the congregation, you don’t need to offer it.",
