    "id": 59113,
    "question": "I wanted to ask the question that if My eyes open just a few minutes before Fajr ends And i know that I won&#8217;t be able to make Wudu and Finish my prayer.Then in that condition Am I Sinful If I lay in my bed or should I get up?",
    "title": "QUESTION: I wanted to ask the question that if My eyes open just a few minutes before Fajr ends And i know that I won&#8217;t be able to make Wudu and Finish my prayer.Then in that condition Am I Sinful If I lay in my bed or should I get up?",
    "answer": "Yes, you will be sinful! You must immediately get up, make wudu and pray even if the time exists since you have a valid reason due to sleeping.",
    "answer_preview": "Yes, you will be sinful! You must immediately get up, make wudu and pray even if the time exists since you have a valid reason due to sleeping.",
    "slug": "question-i-wanted-to-ask-the-question-that-if-my-eyes-open-just-a-few-minutes-before-fajr-ends-and-i-know-that-i-wont-be-able-to-make-wudu-and-finish-my-prayer-then-in-that-condition-am-i-sinful-if",
