    "question": "Next year In’sha’Allah I will visit my hometown so what is the ruling on combining prayers or not going to the masjid to pray which is near my house there? I’ve heard that a person can combine prayers until the person is settled. Is this true? How do I know if I still feel unsettled or if the shaytan is trying to play me to still combine?",
    "title": "QUESTION: Next year In’sha’Allah I will visit my hometown so what is the ruling on combining prayers or not going to the masjid to pray which is near my house there? I’ve heard that a person can combine prayers until the person is settled. Is this true? How do I know if I still feel unsettled or if the shaytan is trying to play me to still combine?",
    "answer": "If its your hometown where you would eventually come back to, you must pray normally, like a resident as soon as you land in your city as you are not considered a traveller anymore.",
