    "id": 58339,
    "question": "Sheikh sahab kindly reply to my previous question. and what if someone has missed prayers for years and now prays 5 times daily, but how to compensate for the missed prayers?",
    "title": "QUESTION: Sheikh sahab kindly reply to my previous question. and what if someone has missed prayers for years and now prays 5 times daily, but how to compensate for the missed prayers?",
    "answer": "It is not permissible to pray the prayers that you didn&#8217;t pray deliberately, without any reason. You must repent sincerely to Allah and never do such a major sin again and do a lot of voluntary good deeds and worship, especially night prayers to try and compensate for the missed prayers.",
