    "question": "If a person prays in chair,in time of ruku and sujud he may go early than imam though he starts his act after imam as he is not prostrating in ground physically,is prayer valid?",
    "title": "QUESTION: If a person prays in chair,in time of ruku and sujud he may go early than imam though he starts his act after imam as he is not prostrating in ground physically,is prayer valid?",
