    "question": "I don&#8217;t get the same satisfaction as before when I pray Salah and when I repeat the translation of surah Faatiha in my mind after every verse, I forget everything, and start again, so now I read without repeating the translation in my mind, but still in surah Faatiah, I repeat verses again and again and I feel as if I have made some mistake. Will Allah accept my prayers if i pray without translt?",
