    "id": 57086,
    "question": "In the masjid I go to, people pray Tahiyatul Masjid and after that Adhan is called and then people stand up to pray 2-4 Rakat and after that Khutbah starts then the Iqamah and then 2 Rakat Jummah prayer and after that you can do 2-4 Rakat Sunnah prayer in the masjid. As far as I know there is no Sunnah before Jummah except Tahiyatul are the 2-4 Rakats after the Adhan an innovation?",
    "title": "QUESTION: In the masjid I go to, people pray Tahiyatul Masjid and after that Adhan is called and then people stand up to pray 2-4 Rakat and after that Khutbah starts then the Iqamah and then 2 Rakat Jummah prayer and after that you can do 2-4 Rakat Sunnah prayer in the masjid. As far as I know there is no Sunnah before Jummah except Tahiyatul are the 2-4 Rakats after the Adhan an innovation?",
