    "excerpt": "ANSWER: If the imam sat mistakenly in the 3rd, you should notify him by saying subhana Allah. If he doesn’t listen and rectify his mistake by standing up to the 4th, you must leave him and stand up to your fourth and finish you prayer alone. It is not permissible to follow him in that [&hellip;]",
