    "title": "QUESTION: Shaykh mistakenly said subhana rabbiyal azeem in sajda what to do ?",
    "answer": "If you realized this while you are still in the sujood, you must correct it. But if you remembered after raising from sujood, you must offer 2 prostrations of forgetfulness before your salam. If you remembered after finishing the prayer, there is nothing you can do now.",
