    "question": "As regards, 2 units of suna before fajr, when you are lait and the jamaa is on for the fajar fard prayer is that you pray suna first and then join the fard or join the fard first. what are the thoughts of scholars in this regard.as a moulana from the sub continent says according to Hanafi and Maliki you can pray suna first and then join the congregation of fard",
    "title": "QUESTION: As regards, 2 units of suna before fajr, when you are lait and the jamaa is on for the fajar fard prayer is that you pray suna first and then join the fard or join the fard first. what are the thoughts of scholars in this regard.as a moulana from the sub continent says according to Hanafi and Maliki you can pray suna first and then join the congregation of fard",
