    "question": "Can I recite dua after adhan when it&#8217;s time for adhan but I can&#8217;t hear it due to rain? Will it be bidah if I do it?",
    "title": "QUESTION: Can I recite dua after adhan when it&#8217;s time for adhan but I can&#8217;t hear it due to rain? Will it be bidah if I do it?",
    "answer": "The sunnah is to repeat after a live athaan and say the dua after hearing it. If you can’t hear it, you shouldn’t say the duaa. If you are a male, you can call the athan yourself and say the duaa.",
