    "question": "At esha prayer in congregation, I forgot to recite surah Fatiha at the last rakah of the prayer. What should i do in that situation?",
    "title": "At esha prayer in congregation, I forgot to recite surah Fatiha at the last rakah of the prayer. What should i do in that situation?",
    "answer": "Pray 1 more rakah and do sujood as sahu after salam and make another set of salam after sujood as sahu. If you did not do that, your prayer is invalid and you must repeat it now.",
