    "excerpt": "ANSWER: The sunnah is that the follower doesn’t move until the imam has reached the final stage of his movement. This means that if he is going for sujood, the follower doesn’t begin to bend his back until the imam’s forehead has touched the ground. This is cascaded in all other movements.",
