    "excerpt": "ANSWER: You must disregard any spotting that come before the period. It is not your menstruation until you see the flow of blood and you must not stop praying, fasting and you can have intimacy with your husband during these spotting. You must wash the affected areas, change the underwear and renew your wudu before [&hellip;]",
