    "question": "Upon travelling on the plane to hometown it was zuhr time but due to hardship in standing &#038; pray &#038; facing the qiblah,I delayed zuhr till asr as I knew I would reach home when there will still be time for asr.I combined zuhr and asr prayer.Praying zuhr as two rakah and praying 4 rakahs for asr as I reached home.Did I do wrong delaying the zuhr &#038; praying 2 rakah for zuhr instead of 4 with asr prayer",
    "title": "Upon travelling on the plane to hometown it was zuhr time but due to hardship in standing &#038; pray &#038; facing the qiblah,I delayed zuhr till asr as I knew I would reach home when there will still be time for asr.I combined zuhr and asr prayer.Praying zuhr as two rakah and praying 4 rakahs for asr as I reached home.Did I do wrong delaying the zuhr &#038; praying 2 rakah for zuhr instead of 4 with asr prayer",
    "answer": "What you did was wrong. You should have offered 4 rakah thuhur and 4 rakah asr as you had reached your hometown and can’t shorten your prayers anymore. Repeat your thuhur now.",
