    "id": 48653,
    "question": "After reciting Surah Fatiha in the 1st and 2nd rak&#8217;ahs of the prayers and forgetting to recite another Surah, the prayers should be completed with Sahu Sijdah in the last sitting.  But in this situation, if I forget to Sahu Sijdah and finish the prayers, do ihave to perform the prayers again?",
    "title": "After reciting Surah Fatiha in the 1st and 2nd rak&#8217;ahs of the prayers and forgetting to recite another Surah, the prayers should be completed with Sahu Sijdah in the last sitting.  But in this situation, if I forget to Sahu Sijdah and finish the prayers, do ihave to perform the prayers again?",
    "answer": "Reciting another surah after fateha is not mandatory, even if you skip that deliberately, still your prayer would be valid, hence there is no sujood as sahu for skipping it.",
