    "id": 48424,
    "question": "I go early to jumuah and do ghusl nicely etc and sit close to the imam but 50% of the time as the qutbah starts I need to go to the washroom and therefore I lose the spot near imam can i wait till the qutba is over and go to the washroom because I like to listen to it and i can catch up with the prayer will i be losing the reward in the hadith because of this?",
    "title": "I go early to jumuah and do ghusl nicely etc and sit close to the imam but 50% of the time as the qutbah starts I need to go to the washroom and therefore I lose the spot near imam can i wait till the qutba is over and go to the washroom because I like to listen to it and i can catch up with the prayer will i be losing the reward in the hadith because of this?",
