    "title": "I got my purity in the form of dryness But when I do wudhu and check if there&#8217;s anything I see small dots of brown or yellow. Sometimes it&#8217;s a bit bigger and so I have to repeat my wudhu again. This repeats several times. What should I do as repeating wudhu like this several times causes many difficulties.",
