    "title": "My mum went to a mall on friday between 10:30 am &#8211; 2:30 pm. I am worried she might’ve purchased some of my things during jummah. I tried to find receipts to verify the time, but I couldn’t. Should the sales be invalid what should I do? I can’t return the items as the receipts are discarded and some of the items she’s opened. Should I give their value to charity or discard them or what?",
