    "id": 46006,
    "question": "When I join behind an imam and I was late so he has already done the first rakaah, do I have to only follow him in his tashahhud or should I also stay sitting after his third rakaah which is my second one and do tashahhud by myself?",
    "title": "When I join behind an imam and I was late so he has already done the first rakaah, do I have to only follow him in his tashahhud or should I also stay sitting after his third rakaah which is my second one and do tashahhud by myself?",
