    "question": "As per the ruling I know it&#8217;s said that the Iqamah for a woman ends when she stands to pray fard , here in India athan for Zuhur and Asr is delayed by hour or more so I pray it at the earliest of time and when I&#8217;m finished with fard then I get to hear the athan being called out.  Question: How should a woman now is supposed to make dua b/w athan and Iqamah?",
    "title": "As per the ruling I know it&#8217;s said that the Iqamah for a woman ends when she stands to pray fard , here in India athan for Zuhur and Asr is delayed by hour or more so I pray it at the earliest of time and when I&#8217;m finished with fard then I get to hear the athan being called out.  Question: How should a woman now is supposed to make dua b/w athan and Iqamah?",
    "answer": "It&#8217;s the time between when the time for that prayer entered until she stands up for her prayer regardless of when the athan or Iqamah is given in the masjid.",
