    "id": 45814,
    "question": "Why imam ahmed bin hanbal said that one who doesn&#8217;t pray witr is a bad person and his witness will not be accepted? Is there any thing backing up it? As far as i know Prophet said to a man who said i will only pray fard prayer not add or decrease any and Prophet said he is in jannah if he do so? So if prophet didn&#8217;t said such thing why imam ahmed said so..? Can you give any ayah or hadees&#8230;?",
    "title": "Why imam ahmed bin hanbal said that one who doesn&#8217;t pray witr is a bad person and his witness will not be accepted? Is there any thing backing up it? As far as i know Prophet said to a man who said i will only pray fard prayer not add or decrease any and Prophet said he is in jannah if he do so? So if prophet didn&#8217;t said such thing why imam ahmed said so..? Can you give any ayah or hadees&#8230;?",
