    "id": 45457,
    "question": "Beside my house is another house beside which is a mosque. For taraweeh and Eid Salah a speaker is connected from the mosque to my house and some women come and pray at my house(with the intention of praying behind the imam in congregation). Is this allowed? And is there Salah valid? Will I be sinful if I connect the speaker for them?",
    "title": "Beside my house is another house beside which is a mosque. For taraweeh and Eid Salah a speaker is connected from the mosque to my house and some women come and pray at my house(with the intention of praying behind the imam in congregation). Is this allowed? And is there Salah valid? Will I be sinful if I connect the speaker for them?",
    "answer": "This is not permissible and the salah is not valid because one must be in the congregation with connecting rows for it to be valid.",
    "answer_preview": "This is not permissible and the salah is not valid because one must be in the congregation with connecting rows for it to be valid.",
