    "question": "when one enters the congregational salah late, does he say allahu Akbar when starting, and then say it again when going into the position as the imam, or does he just say it once and go into the position as the imam?",
    "title": "when one enters the congregational salah late, does he say allahu Akbar when starting, and then say it again when going into the position as the imam, or does he just say it once and go into the position as the imam?",
