    "title": "Sheikh what if we wanted to make a Dua after finishing salah should we just raise our hands and make Dua or pray a sunnah rakah and make Dua in sujoodh? Also in the last hour of Friday should we make Dua in sujoodh or should we pray two rakah and make Dua by raising hands ?",
