    "question": "If I wear tight sleeves and pray will my salah be valid? I wear a long hijab that narrows down and shows the shape of my arms ,also when I am just wearing normal clothing. The sleeves are long and covering my awrah but they do reveal the shape of my arms. I know it&#8217;s not appropriate to wear tight pants and pray in them but what about tight sleeves?",
