    "question": "Shaykh, you had said it&#8217;s permissible to use motor vehicles to go to the masjid quickly to catch jamaa&#8217;ah. What if I go to the masjid late, riding a normal bicycle to catch the jamaa&#8217;ah, will it fall into the prohibition of running/rushing as paddling a bicycle in high speed will make me gasp just as if I ran to the masjid?",
    "title": "Shaykh, you had said it&#8217;s permissible to use motor vehicles to go to the masjid quickly to catch jamaa&#8217;ah. What if I go to the masjid late, riding a normal bicycle to catch the jamaa&#8217;ah, will it fall into the prohibition of running/rushing as paddling a bicycle in high speed will make me gasp just as if I ran to the masjid?",
