    "answer": "When you stood up to pray and if you had intended praying one rakah then it&#8217;s not permissible to change the intention in between. You must only pray one.",
    "answer_preview": "When you stood up to pray and if you had intended praying one rakah then it&#8217;s not permissible to change the intention in between. You must only pray one.",
