    "question": "In India some people they do not stand during nawafil prayer they say we pray nawafil salah sitting is this correct? What about fard prayers?",
    "title": "In India some people they do not stand during nawafil prayer they say we pray nawafil salah sitting is this correct? What about fard prayers?",
    "answer": "No problem in praying voluntary prayers sitting. This is permissible, though this would be half in reward of the person standing up if done without a valid reason. Standing up is a pillar in a fard prayer. Praying obligatory prayer while sitting with no legitimate reason is not permissible and the prayer is void.",
