    "id": 50842,
    "question": "I am going to my relatives who live around 100 miles way and I am staying there for 2 to 3 days so I will have to shorten my prayers unless I pray with the imam,my question is based on the fact I heard you can&#8217;t pray sunnah or nafl on traval,does this also include for the night prayer or am I able to pray that as he night prayer is a nafl?",
    "title": "I am going to my relatives who live around 100 miles way and I am staying there for 2 to 3 days so I will have to shorten my prayers unless I pray with the imam,my question is based on the fact I heard you can&#8217;t pray sunnah or nafl on traval,does this also include for the night prayer or am I able to pray that as he night prayer is a nafl?",
