    "id": 50141,
    "question": "While standing after ruku,  i say &#8220;sami-allah hulimaan hamidah&#8221; then i say &#8220;rabbana wa lakal hamd&#8221; but i&#8217;ve found many of the people saying only &#8220;rabbana lakal hamd&#8221; after ruku. I wanted to know if i&#8217;m doing something wrong or bidaah by adding &#8220;sami-Allah hulimaan hamidah&#8221;? Or i can say this? And when praying behind the imam should we say it while we are moving from Ruku to standing position or after standing straight completely?",
    "title": "While standing after ruku,  i say &#8220;sami-allah hulimaan hamidah&#8221; then i say &#8220;rabbana wa lakal hamd&#8221; but i&#8217;ve found many of the people saying only &#8220;rabbana lakal hamd&#8221; after ruku. I wanted to know if i&#8217;m doing something wrong or bidaah by adding &#8220;sami-Allah hulimaan hamidah&#8221;? Or i can say this? And when praying behind the imam should we say it while we are moving from Ruku to standing position or after standing straight completely?",
