    "title": "When we pray 4 rakat fardh, on the 3rd rakat I made a mistake I started praying a surah on the 3rd rakat after fatiha &#8211; I realised nearly towards the end but didn&#8217;t know whether I was meant to stop reciting and continue and say Allaahu Akbar and go into rukhoo or finish off the surah. So I finished off the surah and then continued. In this instance what are we meant to do?",
