    "title": "I&#8217;m 20 years old. I pray 5 times daily and In sha Allah I&#8217;m going to pray tahajjud also. So my question is.. in my culture people do not pray and they tell me do not be extremist, they tell that if you&#8217;ll start praying so much, some jinn would like your so much ibadah and maybe he could trap you or come inside you. So that&#8217;s why I&#8217;m a little scared to pray tahajjud thinking about this jinn thing.",
