    "question": "Are The Prayer Positions Different For Women Than Men? or There is any difference in the postures of sajdah for man and woman?",
    "title": "Are The Prayer Positions Different For Women Than Men? or There is any difference in the postures of sajdah for man and woman?",
    "answer": "There&#8217;s no difference, none whatsoever. Prophet salla Allahu alaihi wa sallam said, &#8220;Pray as you have seen me praying&#8221;. This instruction is not just for men, rather it&#8217;s for both men and women. The way some women in the subcontinent pray by placing the whole arm on the ground while prostrating is forbidden and totally wrong as Prophet salla Allahu Alaihi wa Sallam forbade this and said you should not prostrate like how a dog sits.",
