    "question": "Pls what is the ruling for a person who comes to masjid during maghrib or Isha to make up all the salah for the day without a valid uzr, and does it very often.",
    "title": "Pls what is the ruling for a person who comes to masjid during maghrib or Isha to make up all the salah for the day without a valid uzr, and does it very often.",
    "answer": "It is not permissible to pray the prayers that you didn&#8217;t pray deliberately, without any reason. You must repent sincerely to Allah and never do such a major sin again and do a lot of voluntary good deeds and worship, especially night prayers to try and compensate for the missed prayers.",
    "answer_preview": "It is not permissible to pray the prayers that you didn&#8217;t pray deliberately, without any reason. You must repent sincerely to Allah and never do such a major sin again and do a lot of voluntary good deeds and worship, especially night prayers to try and compensate for the missed prayers.",
    "slug": "pls-what-is-the-ruling-for-a-person-who-comes-to-masjid-during-maghrib-or-isha-to-make-up-all-the-salah-for-the-day-without-a-valid-uzr-and-does-it-very-often",
    "date": "2020-04-20T22:25:20",
