    "link": "https://www.assimalhakeem.net/pls-what-is-the-ruling-for-a-person-who-comes-to-masjid-during-maghrib-or-isha-to-make-up-all-the-salah-for-the-day-without-a-valid-uzr-and-does-it-very-often/",
    "excerpt": "ANSWER: It is not permissible to pray the prayers that you didn&#8217;t pray deliberately, without any reason. You must repent sincerely to Allah and never do such a major sin again and do a lot of voluntary good deeds and worship, especially night prayers to try and compensate for the missed prayers.",
