    "question": "My question is that at home for jumma i pray full 12 rakats (4 sunnah, 4 farz, 2 sunnah and 2 nafl) whereas in the mosque the imam prays 2 farz only and i heard you should pray atleast 4 farz for duhr or jumma. So who is right here?",
    "title": "My question is that at home for jumma i pray full 12 rakats (4 sunnah, 4 farz, 2 sunnah and 2 nafl) whereas in the mosque the imam prays 2 farz only and i heard you should pray atleast 4 farz for duhr or jumma. So who is right here?",
