    "id": 35499,
    "question": "Even though I try avoiding, still at times owing to unforseen circumstances (once in a month or so) I get stuck in traffic jams in my city which result in me missing the congregation. So, what under such circumstances is better for me especially if there is plenty of time left; to pray alone as soon as I find a Masijd or to lead a prayer in congregation at home with my wife behind me?",
    "title": "Even though I try avoiding, still at times owing to unforseen circumstances (once in a month or so) I get stuck in traffic jams in my city which result in me missing the congregation. So, what under such circumstances is better for me especially if there is plenty of time left; to pray alone as soon as I find a Masijd or to lead a prayer in congregation at home with my wife behind me?",
