    "id": 35058,
    "question": "I made taawba that I wouldnt miss my fajr salah again and that as soon as I either hear my alarm ring or that somebody wakes me up I wont fall back asleep until Ive prayed but I do fall back asleep and get up and pray my fajr a little later but within the time, am I sinful? do I have to offer expation?",
    "title": "I made taawba that I wouldnt miss my fajr salah again and that as soon as I either hear my alarm ring or that somebody wakes me up I wont fall back asleep until Ive prayed but I do fall back asleep and get up and pray my fajr a little later but within the time, am I sinful? do I have to offer expation?",
