    "title": "I didn&#8217;t pray regularly earlier  in my life i prayed for few days and didn&#8217;t pray long then again prayed and stoped like this till age of 20 but now I have repented and realised my mistake and now Alhamdulillah I pray regularly will i have to do Qaza Umre means i have to make up those prayer that I have left in my earlier life will i be sinful if I didn&#8217;t make up those prayer",
