    "question": "Sheikh, I am taking admission in a college away from my hometown, then how should I pray my salah? I mean pray qasar during first 15 days and then start complete salah or should I pray complete all rakah from first day?",
    "title": "Sheikh, I am taking admission in a college away from my hometown, then how should I pray my salah? I mean pray qasar during first 15 days and then start complete salah or should I pray complete all rakah from first day?",
