    "title": "I&#8217;m working in a industrial remote area which they provide transportation. As magrib tym is getting earlier now, I will be in the van when adhan will be given, towards october end If I wait until to get my stop to pray I will be missing the magrib prayer tym. What shall I do in the situation?",
