    "question": "My husband keeps travelling to bahrain from dammam for business purposes. Supposing he goes in mrng and he prays qasr dhuhr n asr by the time he reaches bak to Dammam its asr time , will he hav 2 pray asr again or will the qasr prayer be valid? If yes will it b same for maghrib amd isha ?",
    "title": "My husband keeps travelling to bahrain from dammam for business purposes. Supposing he goes in mrng and he prays qasr dhuhr n asr by the time he reaches bak to Dammam its asr time , will he hav 2 pray asr again or will the qasr prayer be valid? If yes will it b same for maghrib amd isha ?",
