    "id": 32893,
    "question": "When the imam turns around to face the congregation after salah, is this an indication that the prayer is over, or is it something else?",
    "title": "When the imam turns around to face the congregation after salah, is this an indication that the prayer is over, or is it something else?",
    "answer": "This is the Sunnah which the Prophet salla Allahu Alaihi wa Sallam used to observe after fard salah. The prayer is over once he offers salam to the right and left before facing the congregation.",
