    "id": 32641,
    "question": "If I catch the imam at 2nd rak&#8217;ah, which is my first rak&#8217;ah at zuhr or asr prayer, how do I sit for tashahud after my 2nd rak&#8217;ah? Because it&#8217;s imam&#8217;s third rak&#8217;ah and he&#8217;ll stand for his fourth rak&#8217;ah. Please sheikh I need brief explanation of my prayer at such situations.",
    "title": "If I catch the imam at 2nd rak&#8217;ah, which is my first rak&#8217;ah at zuhr or asr prayer, how do I sit for tashahud after my 2nd rak&#8217;ah? Because it&#8217;s imam&#8217;s third rak&#8217;ah and he&#8217;ll stand for his fourth rak&#8217;ah. Please sheikh I need brief explanation of my prayer at such situations.",
    "answer": "You follow the Imam in exactly how he prays and you don&#8217;t sit in tashahud after YOUR 2nd rakah rather you sit with him after HIS 2nd rakha, HIS 4th rakah and you get up after he concluds his prayer and continue to pray and sit after your last rakah.",
