    "question": "I sometime wake up late for fajar salat but when I do wake up I read straight away, and I read 2 Rakat sunnat and 2 Rakat fard is that right or do I just read fard only thank you",
    "title": "I sometime wake up late for fajar salat but when I do wake up I read straight away, and I read 2 Rakat sunnat and 2 Rakat fard is that right or do I just read fard only thank you",
