    "question": "My mom had both knee replacement surgery many years ago doc advised her not to sit on floor and not bend her knee in sajda position.she pray Salah while sitting on chair recently she heard person must start her prayer while standing and in every rakat must stand is it right?plz elobrate proper way of Salah while sitting.",
    "title": "My mom had both knee replacement surgery many years ago doc advised her not to sit on floor and not bend her knee in sajda position.she pray Salah while sitting on chair recently she heard person must start her prayer while standing and in every rakat must stand is it right?plz elobrate proper way of Salah while sitting.",
