    "question": "I heard people saying we are bound to follow congregation rules in fardh only? Is it ok to pray separately (some ppl stand separately but following imam while all other stand in congregation) or not attaching shoulder/feet when praying nafl rakah in congregation (taraweeh &#038; qiyyam).",
