    "title": "Sheikh I pray sunnah before ikamath  While I&#8217;m pray sunnah in 1st rakaath the ikaamath was tell??what I&#8217;m do now&#8230;I continue my pray or leave my prayers and join in jamath..?? Because I hear some prophet SAW words..if ikaamath says there after anyother prayer is vaajib&#8230;",
