    "title": "If a person forgets to bow in the fourth rakah of obligatory prayer &#038; remembers it in the tashadud, then should he stand again &#038; Complete the rakah, considering it as fourth or should he finish of his prayer &#038; again pray the whole Salah?  As bowing is one of the Arkan of the salah.",
