    "question": "One who tries to pray 5 wakt, but sometimes he leaves 1 wakt though he could manage. Does he need to pray kaja prayer before saying the next wakt prayer that he left intentionally or he will just pray repentance prayer nd the next wakt.",
    "title": "One who tries to pray 5 wakt, but sometimes he leaves 1 wakt though he could manage. Does he need to pray kaja prayer before saying the next wakt prayer that he left intentionally or he will just pray repentance prayer nd the next wakt.",
