    "title": "I received good proposal &#038; everything about the guy is perfect.I did istekharah for 2days nd both days noone spoke about the proposal. Then again my family came up with it again nd this time i made istekharah asking Allaah to let my mom nd the guy&#8217;s mom fix the talk if its beneficial for me. But the next day the phone network didn&#8217;t work &#038; they cudnt talk. Is this a negative sign?",
