    "id": 28451,
    "question": "I sometimes go to masjid for juma prayer and pray 2 rakah fard in jamat and leave. Whats the ruling of juma salah for ladies when they pray in masjid and when they pray at home. My parents have told me to pray usual dhur salah even on fridays.but what when v r in masjid.? Pls guide",
    "title": "I sometimes go to masjid for juma prayer and pray 2 rakah fard in jamat and leave. Whats the ruling of juma salah for ladies when they pray in masjid and when they pray at home. My parents have told me to pray usual dhur salah even on fridays.but what when v r in masjid.? Pls guide",
    "answer": "If you go to the masjid for Friday prayer, you should follow the imam and pray 2 rakahs. However, if you pray home, you must pray 4 rak&#8217;ahs of dhuhr even on Friday.",
    "answer_preview": "If you go to the masjid for Friday prayer, you should follow the imam and pray 2 rakahs. However, if you pray home, you must pray 4 rak&#8217;ahs of dhuhr even on Friday.",
    "slug": "i-sometimes-go-to-masjid-for-juma-prayer-and-pray-2-rakah-fard-in-jamat-and-leave-whats-the-ruling-of-juma-salah-for-ladies-when-they-pray-in-masjid-and-when-they-pray-at-home-my-parents-have-told-m",
