    "question": "Shafi Calculation ASR start time/zuhr end time is 1:33 Hanafi asr start time/zuhr end time 2:05, if I pray zuhr between 1:33/2:05 is my Zuhr Valid?",
    "title": "Shafi Calculation ASR start time/zuhr end time is 1:33 Hanafi asr start time/zuhr end time 2:05, if I pray zuhr between 1:33/2:05 is my Zuhr Valid?",
