    "question": "My granma is 80+ or close to 90. for last couple of week she is sick missed prayer. she is on bed can&#8217;t move. her behaviour became a bit abnormal. she normally used to pray 5 times a day. my uncle said to her u dnt hv 2 do d wudu or sit to pray(as u r unable)&#038; u r like a baby. is it correct that whn people reach really old age they r being treated lyk baby?",
    "title": "My granma is 80+ or close to 90. for last couple of week she is sick missed prayer. she is on bed can&#8217;t move. her behaviour became a bit abnormal. she normally used to pray 5 times a day. my uncle said to her u dnt hv 2 do d wudu or sit to pray(as u r unable)&#038; u r like a baby. is it correct that whn people reach really old age they r being treated lyk baby?",
