    "excerpt": "ANSWER: This is baseless. Praise be to Allah. What is mentioned in the question about there being a story of the origin of the tashahhud and that it happened during the ascent of our Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) to heaven (the Mi‘raaj) is something for which there is no basis [&hellip;]",
