    "question": "Sheikh,I was praying Fajr,I broke it,cause I forgot I only needed to pray 2 rakahs.I realized when I got up from tashahhud,about to recite Surah Al-Fatiha,but I cut off.I said Astaghfirullah &#038; began to pray again by making sure that I only need to pray 2 rakahs of Fajr.What I did was correct?",
