    "question": "In salah sometime i realize that i do just one sujood in one rakah, what should i do sheykh,  will sujood saho enough for me, if i forget one sujood?",
    "title": "In salah sometime i realize that i do just one sujood in one rakah, what should i do sheykh,  will sujood saho enough for me, if i forget one sujood?",
    "answer": "Any Rakah you miss sujood in, what follows it is invalid and you must go immediately and offer the missing sujood. If you had reached its position from the following Rakah, this late Rakah takes the place of the previous Rakah and the previous Rakah is rendered void due to the missing sujood. This means that you will add another Rakah to replace the void one and offer sujood assahu after the Salam.",
