    "question": "Shiekh How can I compensate for salah that I miss?&#8230;I often miss fajar salah&#8230;is their any way to reoffer your missed salah?",
    "title": "Shiekh How can I compensate for salah that I miss?&#8230;I often miss fajar salah&#8230;is their any way to reoffer your missed salah?",
    "answer": "If you miss it without a legitimate reason then you cannot compensate for it as it is bound by a fixed specific time! You need to seek forgiveness and make sure that you do not miss it in future again.",
