    "question": "As we know that we cannot pray at 12 noon or midnight what is the reason behind it?? And when should we restart our prayer if it is Qada like isha? Can we pray at 12.01??",
    "title": "As we know that we cannot pray at 12 noon or midnight what is the reason behind it?? And when should we restart our prayer if it is Qada like isha? Can we pray at 12.01??",
    "answer": "It is not permissible to pray voluntary prayers when the sun is right in the middle of the sky, about 10 minutes before thuhur athan. There is no restriction in praying at anytime of the night till the athan of Fajr. &nbsp;",
    "answer_preview": "It is not permissible to pray voluntary prayers when the sun is right in the middle of the sky, about 10 minutes before thuhur athan. There is no restriction in praying at anytime of the night till the athan of Fajr. &nbsp;",
