    "id": 23800,
    "question": "how do i take one out of front row when i am alone in second when they are 1) standing 2) in sujood 3) in tashud",
    "title": "how do i take one out of front row when i am alone in second when they are 1) standing 2) in sujood 3) in tashud",
    "answer": "You must not pull out anyone from any position when you&#8217;re alone in the row. Try to find a gap in the row. If this is not possible at all, You can join the congregation and start praying standing alone in the next row, no problem in that. &nbsp;",
    "answer_preview": "You must not pull out anyone from any position when you&#8217;re alone in the row. Try to find a gap in the row. If this is not possible at all, You can join the congregation and start praying standing alone in the next row, no problem in that. &nbsp;",
