    "id": 23680,
    "question": "I am from Srilanka and i am working in a marketing company. Everyday i used go in field work. In every area we don&#8217;t have mosque to pray. If i got a mosque to pray luhar i don&#8217;t get a mosque to pray asr. On this situation can i pray luhar and asr prayers at once Under rulings of jam&#8217;u &#038; kas&#8217;r.",
    "title": "I am from Srilanka and i am working in a marketing company. Everyday i used go in field work. In every area we don&#8217;t have mosque to pray. If i got a mosque to pray luhar i don&#8217;t get a mosque to pray asr. On this situation can i pray luhar and asr prayers at once Under rulings of jam&#8217;u &#038; kas&#8217;r.",
    "answer": "This is not a legitimate reason to combine prayers as you are not a traveler. If you cannot find a masjid at the time of Asr, you must stop where ever you are to offer Asr on time.",
