    "slug": "i-am-from-srilanka-and-i-am-working-in-a-marketing-company-everyday-i-used-go-in-field-work-in-every-area-we-dont-have-mosque-to-pray-if-i-got-a-mosque-to-pray-luhar-i-dont-get-a-mosque-to-pray",
