    "question": "I missed my asr nimaz yesterday and was in dilemma whether to pray asr after magrib or before  magrib.  Also could one pray missed qaza nimaz say asr with imam when imam is praying magrib?",
    "title": "I missed my asr nimaz yesterday and was in dilemma whether to pray asr after magrib or before  magrib.  Also could one pray missed qaza nimaz say asr with imam when imam is praying magrib?",
