    "question": "A newly married couple where the girl prays all salah but the boy is not into praying salah. When girl wants to get up for fajr prayer and have ghusul husband stops and says to be with him in bed. Should she obey him?!How should she make him understand? Or for some time she listens to him An then shows him the importance. How should she go about?",
