    "question": "A Dua made between the Adhan and the Iqamah is never rejected. Does this apply for women also? Should women give Adhan and make dua then?",
    "title": "A Dua made between the Adhan and the Iqamah is never rejected. Does this apply for women also? Should women give Adhan and make dua then?",
    "answer": "Women must not give azaan. She can make dua after the Azaan has been called till she starts to pray the salah. She can give iqama.",
