    "title": "It was narrated that Anas (may Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: &#8220;Du&#8217;a is not rejected between the adhan and iqamah, so engage in du&#8217;a (supplication).&#8221;  For men its understood as per the masjids iqamat but what is the time span fo women in this regard. Is it same as per local masjids or their personal salah?",
