    "question": "When i pray 2 rak&#8217;at prayer, in the 1st rak&#8217;at as forgetfulness if i sit instead of standing, when I started recite attahyatu I remember its my 1st rak&#8217;at only, what should i do? Stand up? Or complete the prayer with sujood as sahu? Or it could be viceversa i may stand up in my 2nd rak&#8217;at instead ot sitting. Please explain.",
    "title": "When i pray 2 rak&#8217;at prayer, in the 1st rak&#8217;at as forgetfulness if i sit instead of standing, when I started recite attahyatu I remember its my 1st rak&#8217;at only, what should i do? Stand up? Or complete the prayer with sujood as sahu? Or it could be viceversa i may stand up in my 2nd rak&#8217;at instead ot sitting. Please explain.",
