    "id": 22953,
    "question": "After the Adan we should recite the following dua. &#8216;Allahumma Rabba hadhihi&#8217;l-da&#8217;wat il-tammah wa&#8217;l-salat il-qaimah, ati Muhammadan il waseelata wa&#8217;l-fadeelah, wab&#8217;athhu maqaman mahmoodan illadhi wa&#8217;adtah. However,I don&#8217;t hear the adan at all  where I live. I can only hear it if I am at the masjid. I was wondering if I can still recite the dua when I hear it from my phone atthe prayer time?Thanks.",
