    "id": 22924,
    "question": "I usually pray witr after isha prayers and wake up around 3am and pray tahajjud and later fajr. But a friend said that witr should be prayed after tahajjud since it should be the last prayer of the day. What&#8217;s the correct opinion on this?  Im confused because i thought tahajjud was supposed to be considered the next day",
    "title": "I usually pray witr after isha prayers and wake up around 3am and pray tahajjud and later fajr. But a friend said that witr should be prayed after tahajjud since it should be the last prayer of the day. What&#8217;s the correct opinion on this?  Im confused because i thought tahajjud was supposed to be considered the next day",
