    "question": "What does Saheeh Ahadith Say about Recitation of Number of Ayat After Surah Alfatiha. I mean to say that is it compulsory to recite atleast 3 ayats after Surah fatiha or 1 ayat equal to surah Kousar? Can we recite only 1 or 2 ayats after surah fatiha?",
    "title": "What does Saheeh Ahadith Say about Recitation of Number of Ayat After Surah Alfatiha. I mean to say that is it compulsory to recite atleast 3 ayats after Surah fatiha or 1 ayat equal to surah Kousar? Can we recite only 1 or 2 ayats after surah fatiha?",
    "answer": "If you don&#8217;t recite anything after al Fatiha, your prayer is still valid. If the ayah holds a complete meaning, then only one ayah can also be recited after Fateha, for example Ayat Al Kursi.",
