    "question": "In our place masjids do not have facilities for women. Can we still get the reward of Hajj and Umrah if we pray salatul israq at home or it&#8217;s specific for the one who prays it in the masjid?",
    "title": "In our place masjids do not have facilities for women. Can we still get the reward of Hajj and Umrah if we pray salatul israq at home or it&#8217;s specific for the one who prays it in the masjid?",
    "answer": "The reward is specifically for the ones who pray it in the masjid. Prophet salla Allahu aliaihi wa sallam had said that the reward for women praying at home is far better than even praying behind him, in his masjid. So rest assured, Allah is most Merciful.",
    "answer_preview": "The reward is specifically for the ones who pray it in the masjid. Prophet salla Allahu aliaihi wa sallam had said that the reward for women praying at home is far better than even praying behind him, in his masjid. So rest assured, Allah is most Merciful.",
