    "excerpt": "ANSWER:  The reward is specifically for the ones who pray it in the masjid.  Prophet salla Allahu aliaihi wa sallam had said that the reward for women praying at home is far better than even praying behind him, in his masjid.  So rest assured, Allah is most Merciful.",
