    "question": "i know someone who doesn&#8217;t pray at all. not even juma&#8217;a. but in ramadan he fast but still in ramadan he doesn&#8217;t pray. that means he fasts without praying at all. does it mean that he is a kafir? and shall i consider him and call him a kafir?",
    "title": "i know someone who doesn&#8217;t pray at all. not even juma&#8217;a. but in ramadan he fast but still in ramadan he doesn&#8217;t pray. that means he fasts without praying at all. does it mean that he is a kafir? and shall i consider him and call him a kafir?",
