    "question": "I have a baby of 2.5 months old. Often it happens that whenever I offer salah after making my baby sleep, she gets up and starts crying. Though my mother in law tries to soothe her but sometimes she continuously cries that affects my prayer. My Q is which rakahs are there in the 5 prayers that I can skip and which are the rakahs that I have to complete whatever the situation is.",
