    "question": "In prayer, if I finish my stipulated saying, do I remain quiet? For example :- in silent prayer or in silent rakahs, I finish reciting Surah Fatiha and another Surah, in 2nd rakah I finish my Tashahud, do I remain quiet after that?",
    "title": "In prayer, if I finish my stipulated saying, do I remain quiet? For example :- in silent prayer or in silent rakahs, I finish reciting Surah Fatiha and another Surah, in 2nd rakah I finish my Tashahud, do I remain quiet after that?",
