    "question": "Please I would like to know how to correct a prayer in which two ayats of fatiha were mistakenly recited silently in a prayer before remembering it was supposed to be aloud. How should one continue the prayer and which sujud should be done? Also, does the ruling change if more than 2 ayats of fatiha have been recited wrongly?",
