    "id": 66538,
    "question": "I calculate zakat once year and this year I&#8217;m below the silver nisab due to the silver price hike. Do i now recheck and pay next year or as soon as price rises and I&#8217;m over the nisab",
    "title": "QUESTION: I calculate zakat once year and this year I&#8217;m below the silver nisab due to the silver price hike. Do i now recheck and pay next year or as soon as price rises and I&#8217;m over the nisab",
    "answer": "You are not obliged to give zakat as you don’t have the nisab. Once you reach the nisab, this is when you start counting for a lunar year to give your zakat after one year.",
