    "question": "Sheikh if calculate the zakat on my gold on say Nov 1st but I don&#8217;t have the money to pay off all my zakat all at once and I would need to pay it off in installments, do I hold to that one calculation from Nov 1st until I pay it all off or do I recalculate with the gold price for Dec 1st when I&#8217;m paying off the next installment?",
    "title": "QUESTION: Sheikh if calculate the zakat on my gold on say Nov 1st but I don&#8217;t have the money to pay off all my zakat all at once and I would need to pay it off in installments, do I hold to that one calculation from Nov 1st until I pay it all off or do I recalculate with the gold price for Dec 1st when I&#8217;m paying off the next installment?",
