    "id": 56893,
    "question": "If one is not savings neither at the end of every month and same by the end of year but living good life Alhamdulillah. is Zakat 2.5% still due on that person. Note: Doesn’t hold or inherited any property or wealth.",
    "title": "QUESTION: If one is not savings neither at the end of every month and same by the end of year but living good life Alhamdulillah. is Zakat 2.5% still due on that person. Note: Doesn’t hold or inherited any property or wealth.",
    "answer": "If he doesn’t have cash above nisab that&#8217;s with him for a whole hijri year nor he has gold (85gms or more) nor silver (595 gms or more) then there is no zakat on him. There is a big difference of monetary value between the nisab amount of gold and nisab amount of silver in our country. So on which basis should we calculate the nisab?",
