    "id": 56520,
    "question": "I hv alwys seen my fathr pay my mothr&#8217;s gold zakat diligently. I didn&#8217;t knw b4 dt wife is sinful. My hsbnd hs paid zakat 4 last fw yrs. Ds yr i kept remnding him. Nw he tells me he forgot d weight of gold at my home. 4 days left in Eid. No time to sell n give all zakat. My deadline is Eid. Cn u suggest a solution? I don&#8217;t want 2 be sinful. I didn&#8217;t knw he wud not pay this year.",
    "title": "QUESTION: I hv alwys seen my fathr pay my mothr&#8217;s gold zakat diligently. I didn&#8217;t knw b4 dt wife is sinful. My hsbnd hs paid zakat 4 last fw yrs. Ds yr i kept remnding him. Nw he tells me he forgot d weight of gold at my home. 4 days left in Eid. No time to sell n give all zakat. My deadline is Eid. Cn u suggest a solution? I don&#8217;t want 2 be sinful. I didn&#8217;t knw he wud not pay this year.",
