    "title": "I recieved inheritance in 2015, i paid zakat on that, i invested that in builing houses for selling, i paid zakat in 2016/17 also, but in 2018 i didnt had any cash-as all my money was invested in houses, do i need to pay zakat for last 2 years or should i pay this year only. explain in detail.",
