    "question": "Though I&#8217;m aware that it is the obligation of a muslim to pay zakah to his/her relatives first but nowadays I find my relatives in better condition than the conditions of muslimsbrothers and sisters who are oppressed or homeless. Can I distribute some of the portion of my zakah among them?",
    "title": "Though I&#8217;m aware that it is the obligation of a muslim to pay zakah to his/her relatives first but nowadays I find my relatives in better condition than the conditions of muslimsbrothers and sisters who are oppressed or homeless. Can I distribute some of the portion of my zakah among them?",
    "answer": "You can give your zakat to any Poor or needy Muslims, preference is for the relatives. If you don&#8217;t have any poor relatives, you can give it to any other poor or needy Muslim. &nbsp;",
