    "id": 64898,
    "question": "I used 2 slaughter goat, only the throat part, in my uncle&#8217;s shop. But @ times, wt he does is he takes the goat&#8217;s balls and puts it 2 a female goat so tht people wil think it&#8217;s male and wil buy it. Or he takes the tail of a goat and attches it 2 a lamb, making it look like a goat so it gets bought. So my QST is am I sinful if I wrk there just 2 cut throat",
    "title": "QUESTION: I used 2 slaughter goat, only the throat part, in my uncle&#8217;s shop. But @ times, wt he does is he takes the goat&#8217;s balls and puts it 2 a female goat so tht people wil think it&#8217;s male and wil buy it. Or he takes the tail of a goat and attches it 2 a lamb, making it look like a goat so it gets bought. So my QST is am I sinful if I wrk there just 2 cut throat",
