    "question": "Can someone have multiple sacrifices in different countries?  For example: 2 in india, 1 in residing country?  Where 1 whole Indian goat goes to charity  The second for family and friends.",
    "title": "QUESTION: Can someone have multiple sacrifices in different countries?  For example: 2 in india, 1 in residing country?  Where 1 whole Indian goat goes to charity  The second for family and friends.",
    "answer": "This is permissible but it is not per the sunnah The sunnah is to divide each sacrifice into three parts If someone sacrificed 3 sheep, made one charity, one as a gift and the 3rd for himself to eat from, that is wrong! The sunnah is to divide each sheep to three parts",
    "answer_preview": "This is permissible but it is not per the sunnah The sunnah is to divide each sacrifice into three parts If someone sacrificed 3 sheep, made one charity, one as a gift and the 3rd for himself to eat from, that is wrong! The sunnah is to divide each sheep to three parts",
