    "excerpt": "ANSWER: This is permissible but it is not per the sunnah  The sunnah is to divide each sacrifice into three parts  If someone sacrificed 3 sheep, made one charity, one as a gift and the 3rd for himself to eat from, that is wrong! The sunnah is to divide each sheep to three parts",
