    "question": "On sacrificing a goat or prescribed animals on Eid ul Adha, we sacrifice to Allah on behalf of one or many person, my question if one sacrifice is given on  behalf of many, does the reward is getting splitted as many? If 50 rewards in total means,  5 person get 10 reward each? Or each person gets the whole 50 reward? Please clarify",
