    "question": "sheikh my brother&#8217;s wife was in labor on Monday 24th at night but gave birth by 2:30am so what is the actual day she gave birth Monday or Tuesday and when should the naming ceremony be held.",
    "title": "sheikh my brother&#8217;s wife was in labor on Monday 24th at night but gave birth by 2:30am so what is the actual day she gave birth Monday or Tuesday and when should the naming ceremony be held.",
    "answer": "According to the Arabic calendar, new day starts after maghrib. This means that it was Tuesday night and the naming should be done Monday morning.",
