    "id": 26240,
    "question": "As we know, one should not cut hair and nails during first ten days in dhul hijja who are sacrificing animals. I am not sure my husband exactly when cut his nails. If he cut during first 10days of jil hajj, what should we do now as we are sacrificing animals on Eid ul azha.We forget that we should not cut our nails and hair. What to do now to accept our qurbani?",
