    "excerpt": "&nbsp; &nbsp; Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) said that the Prophet (Salla Allahu alahi wa sallam) once said that wealth does not increase because of charity, when you spend money, your wealth does not decrease. And Allah increases his slave in honor when he forgives others and no one humbles himself [&hellip;]",
