    "excerpt": "A’ashora is a happy event where we thank Allah for saving Mosa and the Sons of Israel from Pharos. However, most people associate it with mourning of Al Husain, may Allah be pleased with him. The Shi’a make this an event to express their grief and sorrow! They hit themselves with chains and knives [&hellip;]",
